================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE LICENSES
================================================================================

Capturecard Viewer links the Rust crates listed in section 2 into its
executable. The full text of every license that applies to them is reproduced
in section 3.

Licenses referenced as LicenseRef-* in section 2 are valid SPDX syntax but are
not on the SPDX License List, so cargo-about has no canonical text to fall back
to. Their text is appended at the end of section 3 and is not counted in
section 1.

Capturecard Viewer itself is distributed under the MIT License; see the LICENSE
file at the root of the repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
このファイルは cargo-about が Cargo.lock から生成しています。手で編集せず、
依存を追加・更新したら次のコマンドで作り直してください。

    cargo about generate about.hbs -o THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt

対象ターゲットは x86_64-pc-windows-msvc（Windows 専用アプリのため）。
設定は about.toml、体裁はこのテンプレート about.hbs にあります。
